Z||000001||Hybrid2M6||11-24-2001||09:48 PM||||I have 17's on the back and the gap is noticable less than when I had 16's all around. I'd say its about 2"-3" in the rear compared to 4" when I had 16's back there. The gap is even all around now. Still would look better lowered though. No pix of the new setup as of yet.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/customgfx.jpg"> <BR>1986 SE IronDuke<BR>Adjustable Touring Wing<BR>American Racing Carrera's<BR> -225/50VR16 Falken Ziex 502<BR> -225/45ZR17 Falken Azenis<BR>Cleared and Painted(red) Tail lights||||reg||2
