Z||000003||Nashco||11-25-2001||12:02 AM||||The fender gap depends on what you get for tire sizes.  My tire sizes almost exactly matched stock sizes (on the diameter aspect), so no difference was noticed between stock tires and 17s.  I've lowered the front already (about 1.5 inches) and love it, want to go a little lower.  The rear is still at stock height and it's starting to get on my nerves, it needs lower about 3" to match the front.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
